{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "0DLX", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-stack-coherent-sheaves}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bcdff6136a0be12c40743f70572d7190fd3d5b7844e8c8753df16f877cf1d95f", "source_text": "Properties of the stack of coherent sheaves", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f98483c22ad705948495d9159ac3680dad52c11e70c1325237ec2696d044ed18", "unit_id": "tag:0DLX:title"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0DLX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Cohstack_{X/B}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{quot-theorem-coherent-algebraic-general}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:89f51dbb7c80242383f28be3b708ab1f4112378f22e669820753fc1b2d7ee2a5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c1b86f882a5e5728eb26a2078bd9bce088681214377db245425700a7f9f16e88", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic spaces which is\nseparated and of finite presentation. Then the stack\n<MATH_0002> parametrizing flat families of coherent\nmodules with proper support is algebraic. See\nQuot, Theorem <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f7a5c56d5e83c0ef5438933d7a3d373c875d08ce767332c5d30c93ba4b0dd98b", "unit_id": "tag:0DLX:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DLX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Cohstack_{X/B}$", "MATH_0002": "$B$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-coherent-diagonal-affine-fp}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b1062c81c6536f2902720796d8fc58e9db1baa12fbf7bddf2af0e29bd4cd4cd5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:31eba7a73d206f824c655a1c22f5e7dcd51f18691423c5b8b3a360ef04173276", "source_text": "The diagonal of <MATH_0001> over <MATH_0002> is affine\nand of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:90699b039ada020b59f55c775c8a69db8b537f658ef6861e5a86d4f2d0fca048", "unit_id": "tag:0DLY:statement"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DLX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathit{Isom}(\\mathcal{F}, \\mathcal{G}) \\to T$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X_T}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0005": "$T$", "MATH_0006": "$T$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{quot-lemma-coherent-diagonal}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{section-hom-isom}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:618e1b8aadaa11613f37199e567fccbfc04c7ebcb4a176cb5c3d293a9bbfdf0c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8d7c9b02285865ac8413bcb9aec936f83d39aa672f9fa52613ebc269782a6e2f", "source_text": "The representability of the diagonal by algebraic spaces\nwas shown in Quot, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nFrom the proof we find that we have to show\n<MATH_0001>\nis affine and of finite presentation for a pair of\nfinitely presented <MATH_0002>-modules\n<MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004> flat over <MATH_0005> with support\nproper over <MATH_0006>. This was discussed in Section <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f290f9d82b3d8d75f3807e46d2e319965bb0012891135a3664f7c117c4c6abbf", "unit_id": "tag:0DLY:proof"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DLX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Cohstack_{X/B} \\to B$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-coherent-qs-lfp}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:48b700cdf2658cf090504f7a3b056c2d049387aea65f64f4ca50ce182061b6fb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ca91d1452f25c4fa564f351b112705408e491781d5b7bb1b55ac1f9ab7aab13f", "source_text": "The morphism <MATH_0001> is quasi-separated and\nlocally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d247279dea57e3b75173d3b1b9d3388de47d1b19f70e8576a1e81ff047a93078", "unit_id": "tag:0DLZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DLX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Cohstack_{X/B} \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Cohstack_{X/B} \\to B$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Cohstack_{X/B} \\to B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-coherent-diagonal-affine-fp}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-limits-proposition-characterize-locally-finite-presentation}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{quot-lemma-coherent-limits}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0005642b5476d4fe9487f81ba29ce7c33fdc963ff2830b3c04f47bfa8023ed0c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d738c25650ea70906ef8ff00b2954372b85eb538f7f3700f7615ce1f992ff200", "source_text": "To check <MATH_0001> is quasi-separated we have to\nshow that its diagonal is quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\nThis is immediate from Lemma <REF_0001>.\nTo prove that <MATH_0002> is locally of finite\npresentation, we have to show that <MATH_0003>\nis limit preserving, see\nLimits of Stacks, Proposition\n<REF_0002>.\nThis follows from Quot, Lemma <REF_0003>\n(small detail omitted).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8635f79a20caf0eca102c810175743750dc45a81be41a0893df50f804d841d5b", "unit_id": "tag:0DLZ:proof"}
